  "description": "A rare opportunity to rent a bright and spacious one-bedroom apartment with secure parking, just off Merrion Square\nElegant top floor apartment in a small block of apartments situated in a quiet and safe residential neighbourhood in Dublin’s Georgian Quarter. \nThis apartment is central to the cultural, commercial, financial and tech districts of Dublin. \nFirst letting of this warm dual aspect chic apartment since its redecoration. Excellent storage space. Private secure off-street parking included in rent.\n\nThe apartment comprises;\nA large entrance hall with generous coat closet,\nA lovely generous double bedroom with well-designed wardrobes.\nA large bright bathroom with classic sanitary ware including new Hans Grohe shower, full bath, chrome heated towel rail and electric under-floor heating. Hot press storage.\nGood big kitchen with full range of quality appliances.  Excellent larder space. \nDining area with extending table and storage space. \nComfortable living area with feature coal-effect gas fire and sunny bay window to the front.\nGas-fired central heating throughout.\n\nParking space for one standard sized car in the garage with automatic door at street level is included in the rent.\n\nThis is a smoke free apartment (no smokers need apply).\nNo pets.\n\nViewing, strictly by appointment\n",
